# {{.GameName}}

A full total conversion built on the Ironwail-Go engine
(github.com/darkliquid/ironwail-go/sdk). Every Quake identity (game name,
base data directory, menu labels, CSQC name) is overridden in
`gameconfig.go`.

## Commands

```sh
go mod tidy        # resolve quake + engine module replaces
go test ./...      # run the sim tests
make build         # build the game binary
make run           # build + run (from the parent dir, where ./<modname> is
                   # found; game data is loaded from ./<modname>)
```

## Shipping data (pak)

Mount game data into `<modname>/` (next to this directory) and bundle it
with `qcmod pak pack <modname> pak0.pak` — the engine loads `pak0.pak`
from the base game directory. World textures can be generated from images
with `qcmod wad -type miptex`.

## Gameplay

Port the gameplay surface: the canonical QuakeGo reference implementation
is `pkg/qgo/quakego` in the engine repo — copy it here and adapt it.